    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for what you forgot, but be very careful, you are not the only one in the building and there are signs of this, do what you can to recover what you are looking for, and leave the place as soon as possible... if you can! Prepare to enter into mystery and uneasiness, something is not right and you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rooms of the Beyond the Sky building, interact with whatever you can to help you find what you're looking for, and be sure to listen to the speakers, they reveal information that can help you understand what's going on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ladies and Gentlemen, Beyond the Sky is live!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In terms of communication, Beyond the Sky is an example! The best entertainment program with guests from all niches, always leading the audience, for presenter Fabio the sky is the limit, at least on his program!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/f341b7a2aad181ad57c9e49f769540bf.poster.avif?t=1745122285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/f341b7a2aad181ad57c9e49f769540bf.webm?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/f341b7a2aad181ad57c9e49f769540bf.mp4?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Interact with the scenario</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact, search and explore the scene! Try to do whatever you can to find what you're looking for!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/e432ccf1f2eef7c5bbf7987b9a9737b6.poster.avif?t=1745122285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/e432ccf1f2eef7c5bbf7987b9a9737b6.webm?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/e432ccf1f2eef7c5bbf7987b9a9737b6.mp4?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Run if necessary!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape from the pursuer when he appears or just accept your fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/201c1041170b6c25b60ff2f67109e398.poster.avif?t=1745122285\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/201c1041170b6c25b60ff2f67109e398.webm?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529320/extras/201c1041170b6c25b60ff2f67109e398.mp4?t=1745122285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take what you forgot and leave the building, before there is a chance of something noticing your presence...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game resembles games from the PS2 era, being a first-person horror and mystery genre, and can only be played with keyboard and mouse. It does not contain a save option as there is no need, just follow the story directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar style to PS2</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery, horror and investigation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story not told directly</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dubbed and subtitled in Portuguese</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random scares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When purchasing the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When purchasing this game you receive the full game, with all features, story, content and updates included. Future content such as additional packages (DLCS) or sequels are not included in the purchase of this game, but rather separately. 2007 Games thanks you for your understanding!</p>",
